# MQTT authentication + TLS enforce these identities. No anonymous/wildcard grants.
user gateway
topic read dormenergy/floor1/room1/telemetry
topic read dormenergy/floor1/room1/status
topic write dormenergy/floor1/room1/ack
topic read dormenergy/floor2/room2/telemetry
topic read dormenergy/floor2/room2/status
topic write dormenergy/floor2/room2/ack
topic read dormenergy/floor3/room3/telemetry
topic read dormenergy/floor3/room3/status
topic write dormenergy/floor3/room3/ack

user room1
topic write dormenergy/floor1/room1/telemetry
topic write dormenergy/floor1/room1/status
topic read dormenergy/floor1/room1/ack

user room2
topic write dormenergy/floor2/room2/telemetry
topic write dormenergy/floor2/room2/status
topic read dormenergy/floor2/room2/ack

user room3
topic write dormenergy/floor3/room3/telemetry
topic write dormenergy/floor3/room3/status
topic read dormenergy/floor3/room3/ack
